digraph account_payable_process_59 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"gather the vendors invoice" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "gather the vendors invoice"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_1MO5" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"gather the vendors invoice" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_1MO5"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_1MO5" -> "schedule the payment"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_1MO5" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"schedule the payment" -> "stamp all documents"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_YI4N" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_YI4N"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_YI4N" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"create voucher for the documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_YI4N" -> "create voucher for the documents"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_YI4N" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_YI4N"
		"create voucher for the documents" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_YI4N"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_1MO5" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"stamp all documents" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_1MO5"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_YI4N" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_1MO5"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_1MO5" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the vendor accounting department. 
When sending to the vendor accounting department is completed, creating a receiving report should be done. 
After creating a receiving report, gathering the vendors invoice should be done. 
After gathering the vendors invoice, the next tasks should be scheduling the payment and storing in paid invoice file, they should be done in parallel. 
After scheduling the payment, stamping all documents should be done. 
Once storing in paid invoice file occurs, the next tasks should be entering the invoice into the accounts payable account and creating voucher for the documents, they should be done in parallel. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It starts with a return to the vendor accounting department.
When the transmission to the vendor accounting department is completed, a receiving report should be created.
After creating a receiving report, the vendors invoice should be collected.
After the gathering of the vendors' invoices, the next tasks should be arranging the payment and storing in the paid invoice file, and they should be done in parallel.
After the payment is scheduled, stamping should be done on all documents.
Once storing in the paid invoice file occurs, the next tasks should be entering the invoice into the accounts payable and creating the voucher for documents, this should be done in parallel.
The process is now complete.
"
}
